    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/89a766820d6c04034972bbc61d0d09bb.avif?t=1755098082\" width=800 height=515 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f CURRENT DEVELOPMENT PROGRESS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Stats Last Updated:</i></strong><i>\u00a0July 19th 2025</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i> <br><strong><i>Current game status:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alpha version is currently <strong>live</strong> for fundraiser backers</i><br><br><br><br><i>Sandbox Playtest version is currently <strong>live</strong> for public</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</i>\u00a0<i>General Upcoming Early Access Features (not available in DEMO)</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Expanded different drink recipes: 8/8 COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Expanded decor:  COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Village (NPC) customers: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Day and night cycle: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Bedroom area: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Accessibility: Missing Day &amp; Night cycle length setting COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Save &amp; Load system: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Controller support: COMPLETED</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Extra features:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Skill Tree: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Custom Character Import: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Shop &amp; Delivery System: COMPLETED<br>\ud83d\udfe2 Brewing and Cafe upgrades: COMPLETED<br>\ud83d\udfe2 Newspaper storyline: COMPLETED<br>\ud83d\udfe2 Journal: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Pastry buying &amp; selling: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 Achievements: Not started (TBA towards end of EA development)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Fundraiser Stretch Goals Features &amp; Other:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Sandbox mode: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Cafe Terrace area: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe0 Plushie Decor Set: In progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 Greenhouse: Not started</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 Soundtrack DLC: COMPLETED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe0 Twitch integration: In progress</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde1 A GAME CREATED BY THE COZY COMMUNITY, FOR THE COZY COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your own cozy caf\u00e9</strong> in <strong>Tailside</strong>!\u00a0<strong>Brew coffee</strong>, <strong>decorate</strong> your caf\u00e9, and follow small stories in the daily newspaper.\u00a0<strong>Progress</strong> through <strong>days</strong> and <strong>levels</strong> to unlock new <strong>items, skills, villagers, </strong>and <strong>creature visitors.</strong><br>  <br><strong> \ud83c\udf31 Play at your own pace</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 No time pressure, no stress </strong>  <br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Simple gameplay loop and mechanics</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Sandbox mode for decor fans</strong><br><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Perfect for a coffee break</strong>  <br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/722a3fb724cab0b1ce4a693e3a7ea504.poster.avif?t=1755098082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/722a3fb724cab0b1ce4a693e3a7ea504.webm?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/722a3fb724cab0b1ce4a693e3a7ea504.mp4?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2615\ufe0f PREPARE COFFEE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> the <strong>art of coffee-making</strong> as you fulfill various coffee orders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Prepare <strong>different</strong> types of coffee </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Unlock new options through progression &amp;\u00a0<strong>skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/1340b9dbb6360deb660205ed1cacea68.poster.avif?t=1755098082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/1340b9dbb6360deb660205ed1cacea68.webm?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/1340b9dbb6360deb660205ed1cacea68.mp4?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 DECORATE THE CAFE </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize</strong> every corner of your cafe to <strong>your own unique taste</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Fully customizable <strong>cafe, bedroom &amp; terrace</strong> areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Different decoration <strong>categories</strong>\u00a0with hundreds items to choose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/7cff9b7a3ada3add974bedc8067f45fa.poster.avif?t=1755098082\" width=792 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/7cff9b7a3ada3add974bedc8067f45fa.webm?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/7cff9b7a3ada3add974bedc8067f45fa.mp4?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc<strong> STORIES &amp; VISITORS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little stories find their way through your caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Follow mini storylines in the <strong>daily newspaper</strong> as the days pass</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Unlock <strong>new villagers</strong> and <strong>creature visitors</strong> as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/a9f275f04b7c6f2b9f3526a6e7f6a12f.poster.avif?t=1755098082\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/a9f275f04b7c6f2b9f3526a6e7f6a12f.webm?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922570/extras/a9f275f04b7c6f2b9f3526a6e7f6a12f.mp4?t=1755098082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd8a FOLLOW FOR MORE NEWS AND MONTHLY UPDATES ON NEW FEATURES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is being developed based on community feedback. Join us and watch the game expand, playtest various versions, and suggest your own ideas to be added! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f MODDING SUPPORT &amp; COMMUNITY CONTENT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game lets players import custom characters. These creations are not reviewed or endorsed by the developers. Please only use content you have rights to. All original characters remain the property of their respective owners.</p>",
